  kind: 1
  title: "\u0110\xEAm nh\xE0 \u2014 ng\xE0y 13 (th\u01B0 gi\xE3n)"
  intro: "\xD4n ki\u1EC3u chill: tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi sai c\u0169ng kh\xF4ng sao. S\xE1ng
    mai tr\xEAn l\u1EDBp m\u1EDBi \"h\u01A1i\" g\u1EAFt h\u01A1n."
  questions:
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 13] M\u1ED9t 'nhi\u1EC7m v\u1EE5 ph\u1EE5'
      h\u1EE3p l\xFD t\u1ED1i nay l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "D\u1ECDn b\xE0n (\u0111\u1EC3 mai l\u1EA1i b\u1EEBa)"
    - "T\u01B0\u1EDBi c\xE2y\u2026 tr\xEAn wallpaper"
    - "S\u1EAFp x\u1EBFp file Desktop th\xE0nh m\u1ED9t file t\xEAn 'sau n\xE0y'"
    - "Backup d\u1EEF li\u1EC7u (\xFD th\u1EE9c)"
    correctIndex: 3
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 13] T\u1EA1i sao 'mai l\xE0m' l\u1EA1i
      viral?"
    options:
    - "V\xEC n\xF3 mi\u1EC5n ph\xED"
    - "V\xEC n\xF3 scale t\u1ED1t"
    - "V\xEC n\xF3 c\xF3 community support m\u1EA1nh"
    - "V\xEC deadline l\xE0 illusion"
    correctIndex: 2
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 13] Ch\u1ECDn ph\xE1t bi\u1EC3u '\u0111\xFAng
      tinh th\u1EA7n' sinh vi\xEAn:"
    options:
    - "T\xF4i ch\u1EC9 c\u1EA7n 10 ph\xFAt (\xD724)"
    - "T\xF4i l\xE0m nhanh khi\u2026 \u0111\xE3 mu\u1ED9n"
    - "T\xF4i h\u1ECDc theo batch \u2014 m\u1ED7i h\u1ECDc k\u1EF3 m\u1ED9t batch"
    - "T\xF4i kh\xF4ng stress, stress l\xE0\u2026 b\u1EA1n th\xE2n"
    correctIndex: 1
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 13] Khi n\xE3o b\u1EA1n b\u1EA3o '\u0111\xF3i
      ki\u1EBFn th\u1EE9c' nh\u01B0ng mi\u1EC7ng b\u1EA3o '\u0111\xF3i m\xEC', b\u1EA1n
      l\xE0m g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "Th\u1ECFa hi\u1EC7p: h\u1ECDc m\u1ED9t ch\u01B0\u01A1ng, \u0103n m\u1ED9t
      g\xF3i"
    - "Gi\u1EA3 v\u1EDD \u0111\u1ECDc ch\u01B0\u01A1ng 1 trong khi h\xFAp m\xEC"
    - "\u0110\u0103ng story than th\u1EDF"
    - "T\u1EA5t c\u1EA3 \u0111\u1EC1u \u1ED5n"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[\xD4n ch\u01A1i \u2014 ng\xE0y 13] V\xEC sao l\u1ECBch b\xE1o '13'
      l\u1EA1i c\u0103ng?"
    options:
    - "V\xEC c\xF3 ch\u1EEF '{d}'"
    - "V\xEC th\u1EDDi gian kh\xF4ng wait"
    - "V\xEC messenger hay ping"
    - "V\xEC cosmic radiation"
    correctIndex: 1
    explanation: 
